OL,4,CAustralian music legend Molly Meldrum  
OL,5,Cdies aged 83                           
OL,6,GAustralian music industry legend Molly 
OL,7,GMeldrum has died aged 83 after a long  
OL,8,Gillness.                               
OL,10,FThe music promoter and broadcaster,    
OL,11,Fborn Ian Alexander Meldrum, helped     
OL,12,Fdefine the nation's music tastes for   
OL,13,Fdecades, championing local artists     
OL,14,Flike INXS and Kylie Minogue and global 
OL,15,Facts like Abba.                        
